hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"135","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh Azeem, Haleem hai; Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh arshe-azeem ka Rab hai; Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh aasmanon ka Rab, zameen ka Rab aur arshe-kareem ka Rab hai. [Pareshani par padhe]"
"136","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Teri rahmat ki ummeed rakhta hun; mujhe palak jhapakne tak bhi mere hawale na kar; mere sare kaam sanwar de; tere siwa koi mabud nahin."
"137","[AI-translation] Tere siwa koi mabud nahin; Tu pak hai; beshak main zalimon mein se tha. [Pareshani ki dua]"
"138","[AI-translation] Allah, Allah; mera Rab hai; us ke sath kisi ko shareek nahin karta. [Pareshani par padhe]"
